---
---
<section class="services" id="servicios">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="services-head">
      <p class="label">Lo Que Hacemos</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:.8rem">Nuestros <i>Servicios</i></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="s-card" data-tilt>
        <div class="s-gloss"></div>
        <p class="s-num">01</p>
        <svg class="s-icon" viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="9" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="4" x2="22" y2="0" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="44" x2="22" y2="40" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="4" y1="22" x2="0" y2="22" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="44" y1="22" x2="40" y2="22" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="12.3" y1="12.3" x2="9.5" y2="9.5" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="34.5" y1="34.5" x2="31.7" y2="31.7" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="31.7" y1="12.3" x2="34.5" y2="9.5" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="9.5" y1="34.5" x2="12.3" y2="31.7" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="3.5" fill="#2aa7c8" opacity=".7"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="s-name">Iluminación</h3>
        <p class="s-desc">Shows de luz programados a la música, moving heads, lasers, LED arquitectural y efectos especiales. Diseñamos la paleta visual de tu evento.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="s-card" data-tilt>
        <div class="s-gloss"></div>
        <p class="s-num">02</p>
        <svg class="s-icon" viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="6" y="14" width="8" height="16" rx="4" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <path d="M14 18c4 0 7 2 7 4s-3 4-7 4" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <rect x="30" y="10" width="8" height="24" rx="4" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <path d="M38 14c3 2 3 14 0 16" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="14" y1="22" x2="30" y2="22" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3" opacity=".5"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="s-name">Sonido</h3>
        <p class="s-desc">Sistemas PA profesional, subwoofers de alta potencia, monitoreo en escena y mezclado en vivo. Audio cristalino de 50 a 5 000 personas.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="s-card" data-tilt>
        <div class="s-gloss"></div>
        <p class="s-num">03</p>
        <svg class="s-icon" viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="15" cy="22" r="9" stroke="#2aa7c8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <circle cx="29" cy="22" r="9" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <circle cx="15" cy="22" r="2.5" fill="#2aa7c8"/>
          <circle cx="29" cy="22" r="2.5" fill="#a855f7"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="s-name">DJ &amp; Música</h3>
        <p class="s-desc">DJs residentes y de sesión en todos los géneros. Electrónica, reggaeton, banda, cumbia, pop. Leemos la pista y construimos la noche contigo.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
